      "summary": "One of the best seinen out there with focus on war and strategy with a rich world and politics. An absolute must-read",
      "excerpt": "[title] is undoubtedly one of the most criminally underrated manga out there if you were to ask me. It doesn't get near the amount the love and attention it deserves. Quite peculiar since it could easily hold a candle to the likes of \"One Piece and \"Berserk,\" even \"Tower of God\" if we are talking about webtoons. More or less all which falls in the same category as those mentioned above. It...",
