      "excerpt": "Ok so I read this manga last year but at that time I rushed it without reading it properly by just seeing fighting pannels ... And it was not my fav. At that time I dropped it after some 200 chapters\n\nI restart reading it some 2 weeks ago and myyyy gooood !!!! This is a fuckin masterpiece I mean I literally binged 500+ chapters in just 2 weeks \n\nFirst of all let's talk about its world building\nIn...",
